# Where things are configured
#
# 1. Path of your private data folder (tickets, wiki, briefs, memory, credentials).
#    Default is ~/.aoa. To change it, either export AOA_HOME in your shell, or copy this
#    file to `.env` here in the repo. The repo `.env` is git-ignored and is read for
#    AOA_HOME only; anything else in it is ignored, so no credentials end up in the repo folder.
# AOA_HOME=~/.aoa
#
# 2. Everything else goes into $AOA_HOME/.env (created by ./setup.sh), outside the repo:
#      JIRA_BASE_URL=https://your-site.atlassian.net
#      JIRA_EMAIL=you@example.com
#      JIRA_API_TOKEN=...
#      AOA_SKIP_PREFIX=TIME-
#    (AOA_SKIP_PREFIX is optional: key prefix of timetracking tickets to leave out)
#
# Skills and agents write paths as ~/.aoa/...; with another AOA_HOME, read them as that folder.
